    "northStar": "Solar laboratory",
    "overview": "A solar laboratory operating dashboard: measured data is easy to scan, while the panel model invites exploration. Light neutral surfaces carry readings, histories and setup. Charcoal green grounds the hardware scene and navigation; amber identifies the sunlight experiment and keyboard focus.\n\nControls feel practical and deliberate. Tonal separation and fine borders organize the workspace; perspective and structural shadow belong to the modeled hardware.",
